<#78b4ff>PRIDE</>
Taunt (fills Pride)		^X
Power Up (hold, fills Pride)		^X (hold)
  Landing hits also adds a little Pride. The gold gauge
  is at the bottom, next to the burst icon.
  At full Pride his next special or super gets super
  armour and 25% more damage, then the gauge empties.
  Super Dash and Royal Rekka become their EX versions.

<#78b4ff>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves
  him open.
Grab		^Y
Back Grab		_B^Y
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second
  cooldown.
Ki Charge (hold)		^B_+^C
Dash		_F_F
Back Step		_B_B
Super Jump		_D_U

<#78b4ff>NORMALS</>
Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
Crouching Light / Medium / Heavy		_D^A / _D^B / _D^C
  Crouching Heavy is the launcher uppercut.
Sliding Kick		_DF^C
Breaker Kick		_F^C
Dash Attack (while running)		^C
Air Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
Raccoon Elbow (air, overhead)		_D^B
Reverse Breaker Kick (air)		_B^B

<#78b4ff>SPECIALS</>
  C is the strongest version.
Super Dash		_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C
Royal Rekka		_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C
  Then ^A (low) / ^B (mid) / ^C (high), then
  ^A / ^B / ^C again for the ender.
Straight Shooter (ground/air)		_F_D_DF^A / ^B / ^C
Royal God Fist		_D_D^A / ^B / ^C
Grounder (air)		_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C

<#78b4ff>SUPERS</>
Atomic Burst / air Niagara Pummel (1 bar)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^A_+^B
Final Impact (1 bar)		_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^A_+^B
  Any two of A / B / C. Final Impact: press A / B / C
  as each hit lands for the follow-ups.
Final Flash (3 bars)		_F_B_DB_D_DF_F^C
Elite Assault (3 bars, air)		_F_B_DB_D_DF_F^C
  The ender depends on Vegeta's life: Spirit Breaking
  Cannon, Big Bang Attack at 50% or less, Falling
  Empire at 25% or less.
